ement of $A$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{A}={-18,-14,-10,-6,-2,2,6,10,14,18}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-81205/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "49251196-c06b-5718-82e6-5ed9450301af"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81205"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-81206/selection/7508dd17fb4a409925aa27e6d2fca0752f050d2538758cb6afe94ce201acbc86" :answer/id #uuid "cc9d30f3-3974-5658-a7ac-047c9bc91c36" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{-75,-65,-55,…,30}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81206/selection/3be67074183f4f125099dc9a1db7a903116ada1b22994813ad397faf9328c650" :answer/id #uuid "92f6308e-0b2e-53ad-8dfa-9ad817647e78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{-75,-65,-55,…,25}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81206/selection/872808fd7b72560e3f8d6841c2ac55828ebd6833411c46ea72c879511399979e" :answer/id #uuid "28c08420-cbfd-5b9f-8b54-131b89a64da5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{-75,-65,-55,…,35}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81206/selection/31ffbebbbf27bb9dfad681b0fa1c236ebf96ac5ece653de63254bbda255a6bd0" :answer/id #uuid "c9c67403-b4d7-5dbb-84e7-5fb2795f5c31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{-75,-70,-65,…,25}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81206/selection/49685aad7a7b1d82a234b8d3ba23aad2104067d6949d62d1caab8885f39d5ce7" :answer/id #uuid "38a46be0-31f5-5e33-bfea-1b59bea9cd6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{-75,-60,-45,…,25}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81206/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4ee85bb5-8edd-526c-806d-2b23dbc0f371" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-81206/selection/3be67074183f4f125099dc9a1db7a903116ada1b22994813ad397faf9328c650" :answer-field/choices ["q-81206/selection/7508dd17fb4a409925aa27e6d2fca0752f050d2538758cb6afe94ce201acbc86" "q-81206/selection/3be67074183f4f125099dc9a1db7a903116ada1b22994813ad397faf9328c650" "q-81206/selection/872808fd7b72560e3f8d6841c2ac55828ebd6833411c46ea72c879511399979e" "q-81206/selection/31ffbebbbf27bb9dfad681b0fa1c236ebf96ac5ece653de63254bbda255a6bd0" "q-81206/selection/49685aad7a7b1d82a234b8d3ba23aad2104067d6949d62d1caab8885f39d5ce7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-81206" :question/id #uuid "579decd3-1e02-54bf-b9cc-2b261af84aae" :question/math-academy-id "q-81206" :question/problem "If $U={-80,-75,-70,…,30}$ is the universal set and $A={-80,-70,-60,…,30},$ then $\\overset{―}{A}=$" :question/worked-solution "The complement of $A,$ denoted $\\overset{―}{A},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $A.$\n\nThe universal set $U$ consists of the multiples of $5$ from $-80$ through $30,$ while the set $A$ consists of the multiples of $10$ from $-80$ through $30.$\n\nSo, the only elements of $U$ that are not in $A$ are the multiples of $5$ from $-75$ through $25$ that are not multiples of $10.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $A$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{A}={-75,-65,-55,…,25}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-81206/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "49251196-c06b-5718-82e6-5ed9450301af"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81206"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105178/selection/749b5639ab15cca076b8b08802161a8a274a9f7113528d9ab49421e1cb12aaa3" :answer/id #uuid "e86cdd70-7de1-56d2-bbc6-5d256ce12a11" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{20,30,40,50}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105178/selection/6ce78d2b87feea83d43aebfe5aea1a434954a151fce7b6c3c633f63cb5aa6c0c" :answer/id #uuid "882351be-c07a-5c84-905a-e047b2aeada4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{10,20,30,40}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105178/selection/9011a7c67376bd932907ed6c31550931e241ed23dffc2d1fbc08325c754c7aa0" :answer/id #uuid "0e3f